text = "In Brazil, there is a game called Truco. It is a betting game, where you and a partner face two other people, counting cards, betting points and trying to make it to 12 points, before the other pair makes it. In order to do this, you will play Hands, a set of three rounds where in each round, every player will play one card of the three they have. Whoever has the highest card, wins the round. Whoever wins two rounds, wins the Hand."
fit_content = true
